  To calculate the eEDM enhancement factor W_d according to stratagem 2
  (Lindroth et al., JPB 22, 559, 1989), this scalar operator must be used
  together with the "iBETAGAM" type operator.
  The scalar operator EDM is defined as KINENER (-\nabla^2/2) multiplied by 4*CVAL.
